lieved that ace would be the inheritor  of his father's will that may well have  been shanks's true purpose and in my  opinion something like that makes far  more sense than just having him randomly  decide to spend the entire year in this  place i find it very difficult to  believe that shanks and his crew  wouldn't be able to find ace if that was  their real mission since ace was hiding  out on a mountain just behind the  village if shanks had enough intel to  look for ace in fuchsia village he would  certainly have been able to find him on  that mountain after a year of searching  but maybe shanks wasn't looking for ace  specifically maybe he was looking for  the rightful user of the gomu gomunomi  devil fruit we recently learned from the  gorosei that the gomu gomu nomi aka the  nika devil fruit has a will of its own  and it is as if this devil fruit has  been deliberately running away from the  world government for centuries if we  assume that shanks knew more about the  nika fruit than he let on initially he  may have been trying to determine whom  the nika fruit itself wanted to go to  next somehow shanks had the feeling that  the fruit wanted to be in fuchsia and  since ace was nearby as well shanks may  have been waiting for ace to eat it i  mean it's hard to understand why the red  hair pirates would have left the fruit  unguarded within the reach of a random  kid unless shanks was relying on fate or  on the fruit itself to determine who is  worthy of consuming it and in the end as  we know the fruit chose luffy soon after  the fruit was eaten the red hair pirates  packed up and left fuchsia although not  before shanks saved luffy's life  sacrificing an arm in the process and  then giving luffy his straw hat along  with a lifetime supply of motivation to  become a great pirate but then the big  question is this  if shanks knew the true power of the  nika fruit and he had been waiting for  the fruit to choose its next user why  wouldn't he take luffy with him why  would shanks leave luffy's safety up to  fate instead of taking him along and  grooming him into the perfect vessel for  the nika fruit honestly the best  explanation i have for this is that  shanks didn't want the world government  to know about luffy and that he was the  new user of the nika fruit if luffy had  traveled with shanks he likely would  have been on the government's radar  right away and the secret would be out  immediately by leaving luffy in a small  village in the east blue shanks allowed  luffy to grow and develop his powers  with relative anonymity which protected  him from becoming a target for the world  government and of course as a marine  garp was the ideal person to protect  luffy from unwanted attention by the  world government something that shanks  could never give him i mean the fact  that garp decided to take luffy up into  the mountains and place him in the care  of curly dadan right after he developed  his rubber powers seems to back up this  line of thinking instead of having luffy  walking around town and showing everyone  his rubber powers on a daily basis he  was taken to a much more discreet  location up in the mountains where he  would draw a lot less attention and even  though shanks left luffy all those years  ago he has been keeping tabs on him and  his adventures as was shown multiple  times shanks has also been engaging in  some serious politics and diplomacy he  stopped the war at marine ford before  even more damage was done to luffy and  the whitebeard pirates and he prevented  kaido from intercepting the whitebeard  pirates on their way to marineford we  know that shanks promised to meet up  with luffy again once luffy became a  great pirate so we know that luffy is  still part of shanks's master plan but  what is that master plan why is shanks  doing everything that he's been doing  including the theft of the nika fruit  the mysterious stay in fuchsia his rise  to the status of yonko and so on what is  shanks really up to for the answer to  that we have to go back to his shocking  and highly secretive private meeting  with the gorosei during the reverie as i  mentioned earlier during the reverie  shanks infiltrates pangaea castle the  base of operations for the world  government  there he gains a private audience with  the gorosei themselves with the intent  of discussing quote unquote a certain  pirate but perhaps even more surprising  than shanks showing up there in the  first place is the reaction of the  gorosei to shanks's presence they appear  to be only mildly surprised to see him  and they are certainly not shocked or  intimidated by the fact that he is here  in fact they even dismiss their security  guards so that they can speak to shanks  privately this indicates a certain level  of trust between shanks and the gorosei  and the reaction of the gorosei to  shanks's visit tells me that this is not  the first private meeting they've had i  believe that shanks has met with them in  secret multiple times and so the big  question then is why why is shanks  engaging in secret dealings with the  rulers of the world government a  tyrannical regime that he presumably  wants to destroy proponents of the  villain shanks theory have argued that  shanks is working with the world  government and that he is luring luffy  and other key players into a trap but i  don't think that shanks is a villain  that said i do think that shanks is far  more machiavellian than he made himself  out to be in early one piece and i  believe that his secret dealings with  the gorosei are part of his strategy to  outmaneuver the other yonko and  especially blackbeard and speaking of  blackbeard when shanks says to the  gorosei that he is here to discuss a  certain pirate most people automatically  assumed that he was talking about  blackbeard after all he tried to warn  people about blackbeard before including  whitebeard on more than one occasion but  at the same time it's fair to say that  at this point in the story the gorosei  don't really need any more warnings  about blackbeard they are fully aware of  what a massive threat he poses to the  stability of the entire world like sure  shanks may have some additional  information about blackbeard's creepy  powers and special devil fruits that the  gorosei may not know about but it is  also possible that shanks was there to  talk about another pirate altogether the  villain shanks theorists believed that  he was there to warn them about luffy  and the fact that he was about to awaken  the nica devil fruit this is why the  gorosei abruptly ordered the cp-0 agent  on wano to kill luffy immediately no  matter the cost  but it doesn't make sense for shanks to  sacrifice his own arm to save luffy's  life only to try to get luffy killed  later on this scenario would only make  sense if shanks knew that luffy needed  to die before his devil fruit awakened  and he was brought back to life because  that is exactly what ended up happening  luffy died in the fight against kaido  his heart stopped but then it started  beating again as the nika fruit awakened  for the first time in 800 years and as  zunisha declared that joyboy has  returned if shanks knew that luffy was  now ready to awaken his devil fruit and  if he knew that luffy had to first die  in order to awaken it then the idea that  he might have tricked the gorosei into  having luffy killed begins to make some  more sense  and this brings me all the way back to  roger and that ancient weapon that he  knew about back when he was confronted  by shiki i recently made an entire video  talking about the possibility that  joyboy may actually be the ancient  weapon uranus and that the nika devil  fruit could be the catalyst for actually  activating this ancient weapon poseidon  is associated with the sea and has taken  the form of shirahoshi pluton is  supposedly a massive battleship that is  hidden somewhere on alabasta and uranus  a weapon whose name is associated with  the sky and the heavens is actually sun  god nika be sure to check out that full  video if you're interested there are too  many details to get into here but i will  link it down in the description however  i do want to bring up one interesting  detail that was pointed out to me in the  comments of that uranus video by a user  named dylan davis dylan pointed out that  at the end of episode 126 of the one  piece anime we see king cobra of  alabasta standing in front of three  symbols that are written in the style of  ancient hieroglyphics these symbols are  a boat a sea monster slash sea king and  the sun pluton poseidon uranus a warship  a force that can command the sea kings  and finally sun god nika if this theory  is correct then the ancient weapon that  roger knew about may have been uranus he  knew the truth about the nika devil  fruit and he passed that knowledge onto  shanks  shanks then went out of his way to steal  this fruit he let the fruit itself  choose its next user and he kept an eye  on this user and protected him from afar  until the user reached the point at  which shanks believed that he was ready  to awaken the true power of nika joyboy  and uranus knowing that luffy must first  die before fully unlocking this ancient  power shanks instructs the gorosei to  kill him but little did the goro say  know that by killing luffy they didn't  eliminate him as a threat rather they  created the very threat that they were  trying to eliminate shirahoshi and luffy  are the two sovereigns mentioned in the  prophecy just like shirahoshi is the  ancient weapon poseidon luffy has become  the ancient weapon uranus and shanks can  now use that weapon to finally bring his  master plan to fruition and of course  that plan can only be one thing to  defeat both blackbeard and the world  government and to usher in a new world  the kind of world that roger wanted to  create the same kind of world that  joyboy wanted to create and the same  kind of world that luffy wants to create  a world where freedom triumphs over  tyranny where joy triumphs over sorrow  and where every man and woman are free  to embrace their own great adventure but  massive global revolutions don't just  happen by themselves and they don't just  happen because you want it to happen the  overthrow of the world government and  the arrival of a new dawn and a new  world requires masterful strategy  skillful diplomacy and machiavellian  political tactics these are not things  that luffy has ever been very good at  but this is where shanks comes in that  is what shanks has been doing all this  time he has been betting on the new era  he has been setting the stage for the  revolution and he has been overseeing  the growth of the ultimate weapon in his  arsenal monkey d luffy  i will say that i find it a bit odd that  none of the red hair pirates seem to be  devil fruit users at least none of them  are confirmed to be all the other yonko  have been devil fruit users and many of  their crew members are as well since  shanks made a big deal about being able  to swim back in that first chapter i  wonder if there is some specific reason  why the red hair pirates need to retain  their ability to swim like maybe in  order to get to laughtale you need to  actually physically swim part of the way  like through an underwater cave or  something and if there isn't some big  reason why the red hair pirates need to  retain their ability to swim i wonder if  shanks will end up consuming a devil  fruit at some point in the future maybe  the nika fruit wasn't the only legendary  devil fruit that shanks was able to  locate and with mythical zones being all  the rage right now it will be extremely  cool to see shanks reveal a godly  mythical zone ability of his own  personally i hope that it will be a  devil fruit that suits his color scheme  so like some sort of red dragon zone or  maybe a god of war mars zone that kind  of thing let me know what you guys think  will shanks ever get a devil fruit and  if not is there a specific reason for  that also what do you think is shanks's  master plan did he know the truth about  the nika fruit before he stole it why  did he spend a year in fusha village why  did he meet privately with the gorosei  let me know down below if you guys  enjoyed this video and you want to see  more one piece content in the future  leave a quick like and comment it only  takes a second but it helps with that  youtube algorithm and remember that  subscribing and hitting that  notification bell is a completely free  but very important way of directly  supporting the channel you can also hit  me up on twitter and instagram at  animeopror as always thank you guys so  much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys
 

